<FeatureFacts id="coach-library" />

Programs › Exercises lists your own exercises, cardio and drills, and the exercise and mobility
packs you've added, each with how many programs use it. LogIt's own exercises are always there.

Anything used in a program you've assigned goes to that client with the program, read-only, so they
can do it and swap by muscle. For the rest, choose whether clients see them: shared items show in
their library and pickers as yours. Packs are data, so clients don't have to allow anything.

New exercise opens your library, where you add one with its muscles and your cues.
